  "timeline_meta_description": { eng: "Explore the full Slay the Spire 2 timeline across every epoch, story arc, and era. Track story progression, unlockable cards, relics, and potions.", deu: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Zeitleiste (Deutsch). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", esp: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Línea de tiempo (Espanol (ES)). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", fra: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Chronologie (Francais). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", ita: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Cronologia (Italiano). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", jpn: "スレイ・ザ・スパイア2 (STS2) タイムライン (日本語). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", kor: "슬레이 더 스파이어 2 (STS2) 타임라인 (한국어). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", pol: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Oś czasu (Polski). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", ptb: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Linha do tempo (Portugues (BR)). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", rus: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Хронология (Русский). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", spa: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Línea de tiempo (Espanol (LA)). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", tha: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) ไทม์ไลน์ (ไทย). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", tur: "Slay the Spire 2 (STS2) Zaman Çizelgesi (Turkce). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", zhs: "杀戮尖塔2 (STS2) 时间线 (简体中文). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step.", zht: "殺戮尖塔2 (STS2) 時間線 (繁體中文). All epochs, eras, and story arcs with cards, relics, and potions unlocked at each step." },
  "timeline_tagline": { eng: "Explore the full Slay the Spire 2 timeline across every epoch, story arc, and era. Track story progression, unlockable cards, relics, and potions.", deu: "Erkunde die vollständige Slay the Spire 2 Zeitleiste durch jede Epoche, Geschichte und Ära. Verfolge Story-Fortschritt, freischaltbare Karten, Relikte und Tränke.", esp: "Explora la cronología completa de Slay the Spire 2 a través de cada época, arco narrativo y era. Sigue la progresión de la historia, cartas, reliquias y pociones desbloqueables.", fra: "Explorez la chronologie complète de Slay the Spire 2 à travers chaque époque, arc narratif et ère. Suivez la progression de l'histoire, les cartes, reliques et potions à débloquer.", ita: "Esplora la cronologia completa di Slay the Spire 2 attraverso ogni epoca, arco narrativo ed era. Segui la progressione della storia, carte, reliquie e pozioni sbloccabili.", jpn: "Slay the Spire 2の完全なタイムラインをエポック、ストーリーアーク、時代別に探索。物語の進行、アンロック可能なカード、レリック、ポーションを追跡。", kor: "에포크, 스토리 아크, 시대별로 Slay the Spire 2의 전체 타임라인을 탐색하세요. 스토리 진행, 잠금 해제 가능한 카드, 유물, 물약을 추적.", pol: "Eksploruj pełną oś czasu Slay the Spire 2 przez każdą epokę, łuk fabularny i erę. Śledź progres fabuły, odblokowywalne karty, relikty i mikstury.", ptb: "Explore a linha do tempo completa de Slay the Spire 2 em cada época, arco narrativo e era. Acompanhe o progresso da história, cartas, relíquias e poções desbloqueáveis.", rus: "Исследуйте полную хронологию Slay the Spire 2 по всем эпохам, сюжетным аркам и эрам. Отслеживайте прогресс сюжета, открываемые карты, реликвии и зелья.", spa: "Explora la cronología completa de Slay the Spire 2 a través de cada época, arco narrativo y era. Sigue la progresión de la historia, cartas, reliquias y pociones desbloqueables.", tha: "สำรวจไทม์ไลน์ทั้งหมดของ Slay the Spire 2 ทุกยุค อาร์คเรื่องราว และยุคสมัย ติดตามความคืบหน้าของเรื่อง การ์ด เรลิก และยาที่ปลดล็อกได้", tur: "Her epok, hikaye yayı ve çağ boyunca Slay the Spire 2'nin tam zaman çizelgesini keşfedin. Hikaye ilerlemesini, kilidi açılabilir kartları, kalıntıları ve iksirleri takip edin.", zhs: "探索杀戮尖塔2横跨每个纪元、故事弧和时代的完整时间线。追踪故事进展、可解锁的卡牌、遗物和药水。", zht: "探索殺戮尖塔2橫跨每個紀元、故事弧和時代的完整時間線。追蹤故事進展、可解鎖的卡牌、遺物和藥水。" },
